\f1\fs22 Eloise arrived at the Ironing Room a few minutes after Sarah, and immediately noted how indolent everyone appeared. The junior techs and Johnny sat at workstations looking at their own devices rather than monitors. The Sages stood in a corner, obscuring some of the front wall displays that no one was looking at. A view of the passive Washing Machine remained visible on the largest panel of the screens. Only Dr Ortolan was studying anything\'97a maximised window on which text was scrolling fast and a progress bar was growing slow.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

